    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89442" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσικνέομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>come to, reach</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆγμα δὲ
				λύπης οὐδὲν ἐφ᾽ ἧπαρ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				792
			</span></i> (anap.): also c. gen., <i>reach so far as, come at</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξῳ γὰρ οὔτις πημάτων προσίξεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					1033
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὶν ἐκεῖνον προσικέσθαι
			σου</span> is f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				761
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>approach as a suppliant</i>, c. acc. loci, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				1035
			</span></i>.</div>
